const TCL=[
["01","Overview &amp; Eligibility","<p>These Terms &amp; Conditions govern participation in the Traders Unite Trading Competition (Season 1). The tournament is intended for <b>serious traders</b> who wish to test their skill, strategy and discipline against others in a fair environment.</p><p>By paying the entry fee and joining the tournament, every participant confirms that they have read, understood and accepted these terms in full.</p>"],
["02","Trading Freedom","<p>This tournament has <b>no restrictive trading rules</b>. Participants may trade in whatever way they find most effective, including but not limited to:</p><div class=\"chips\"><span>Manual trading</span><span>Algo bots / EAs</span><span>Indicators</span><span>Martingale</span><span>Grid strategies</span><span>Copy trading</span><span>Any other strategy</span></div><p>The competition is meant to be an open, free trading environment. Basic fair play still applies: no malpractice and no tampering with results.</p>"],
["03","Ranking Criteria &amp; Tie-Breaker","<p>The top 3 positions are decided <b>only by Net PnL</b>, calculated after the competition has ended. If participants are level, the following order is applied:</p><div class=\"flow\"><div><b>1</b><h4>Net PnL</h4><p>Highest net profit after the competition ends takes the higher position.</p></div><i>→</i><div><b>2</b><h4>Win Rate</h4><p>If Net PnL is identical, the higher win rate takes the position.</p></div><i>→</i><div><b>3</b><h4>Shared Position</h4><p>If win rate is also identical, both participants receive that position.</p></div></div>"],
["04","Commencement of the Tournament","<p>The tournament will start <b>only when 30 serious traders have joined and paid their entry fee</b>. This condition ensures a meaningful and fair competition for everyone.</p><p>The official start will be announced in our community. Until then, no trading period is considered to have begun.</p>"],
["05","Entry Fee &amp; Refund Policy","<div class=\"two\"><div class=\"rf ok\"><h4>If the tournament does NOT start</h4><p>Your entry fee will be <b>refunded in full</b>. If a refund is not made, you have every right to take appropriate action against us.</p></div><div class=\"rf no\"><h4>Once the tournament HAS started</h4><p>The entry fee is <b>non-refundable</b>. From that point you are considered an active competitor and cannot request a refund.</p></div></div>"],
["06","Live Standings &amp; Updates","<p>During the tournament, participants may ask our team for the <b>current top 3 positions</b> at any time. We will also try to publish standings updates on our own schedule.</p><p>To stay informed, please remain connected with our team and follow the announcements in our community.</p>"],
["07","Transparency After the Tournament","<p>After the tournament ends, we will share the <b>winners' account details in our group</b>, so that anyone can verify their trade histories.</p><p>We maintain transparency and honesty to the best of our ability, and this tournament is designed to be fair for every serious trader. We ask all participants to compete with a clear, focused mind.</p>"]
];
